-- title:
--   Halfspace Splitting: abelian presentation one side generates
-- statement:
--   An abelian presentation whose defining words each use generators from just
--   one of two covering families is generated by one family alone. There is no
--   amalgam decomposition hypothesis: the twisting map is constructed from the
--   actual relators.
--
--   Source: https://github.com/Achxy/k-17-124/blob/16624b89b2bb8c8c61f023bd153c6c60707720f3/Kourovka/Halfspaces/HalfspaceSplitting.lean#L64-L131
-- source:
